		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05gym0101_glasses_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ようこそ！　あなたに
これを　さしあげるっす！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T04:06:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ようこそ！　あなたに
これを　さしあげるっす！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T04:06:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・ジムバッジ取得前＋アイテム入手前
・ジムに入ると
　主人公に隣接してメッセージ表示
・No030「おいしいみず」入手
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T04:06:49" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>DANPEI
ダンペイ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
